<HEAD>PART 519&#x2014;EMPLOYMENT OF FULL-TIME STUDENTS AT SUBMINIMUM WAGES
</HEAD>
<AUTH>
<HED>Authority:</HED><PSPACE>Secs. 11 and 14, 52 Stat. 1068; sec. 11, 75 Stat. 74; secs. 501 and 602, 80 Stat. 843, 844 (29 U.S.C. 211, 214).
</PSPACE></AUTH>
